# Cloudflare Pages SPA fallback. `expo export -p web` emits a single index.html
# (app.json sets no web.output, so the export is a client-rendered SPA), which
# means every route below the root - /workouts/templates, /clients/[id] - exists
# only once expo-router boots. Without this line a refresh or a shared deep link
# asks Pages for a file that was never written and gets a 404. Files in public/
# are copied to the export root, so this ships in dist/ untouched.
/*    /index.html    200
